{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Reply to a comment"},"description":"Reply to a comment on one of your posts. The reply is posted publicly, immediately, in that account's name, and cannot be unsent from here.\n\ncomment_id is a comments_list row's id, not the platform's. The reply is threaded under that comment.\n\nIt returns status \"sent\" only when the platform gave the reply an id. \"pending\" means the platform did not answer and the outcome is unknown: it is confirmed within the hour, and retrying with the same idempotency_key is safe and will not post twice.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"comment_id":{"description":"The comment to answer, from comments_list.","type":"string"},"idempotency_key":{"description":"Reuse on retry to avoid replying twice; returns the original reply. Reusing it with different words is refused.","type":"string"},"message":{"description":"What to say, as written.","minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["comment_id","message"],"type":"object"},"name":"comments_reply","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"reply":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"body":{"type":"string"},"createdAt":{"format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d(?::[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?)?(?:Z))$","type":"string"},"externalCommentId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"id":{"type":"string"},"lastError":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"platformCommentId":{"type":"string"},"sentAt":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d(?::[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?)?(?:Z))$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"socialAccountId":{"type":"string"},"status":{"enum":["pending","sent","failed"],"type":"string"},"via":{"enum":["dashboard","mcp"],"type":"string"}},"required":["id","platformCommentId","socialAccountId","body","via","status","externalCommentId","lastError","createdAt","sentAt"],"type":"object"}},"required":["reply"],"type":"object"},"title":"Reply to a comment"}
